ically be even more successful with the right publicity on their end \u2013 Kickstarter would find this information extremely valuable. We could also provide a service to a prospective user of a crowdfunding campaign, on ways that they can optimize their campaign itself to give themselves the best chance of being successful.","topics":[],"score":181744,"global_rank":415300},{"name":"ShreyansPatell/ShreyansPatell","owner":"ShreyansPatell","html_url":"https://github.com/ShreyansPatell/ShreyansPatell","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Config files for my GitHub profile.","topics":["config","github-config"],"score":181744,"global_rank":415301},{"name":"burcu-erkan/hover-time","owner":"burcu-erkan","html_url":"https://github.com/burcu-erkan/hover-time","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Created with CodeSandbox","topics":[],"score":181744,"global_rank":415302},{"name":"YusakuNo1/evaluate-test","owner":"YusakuNo1","html_url":"https://github.com/YusakuNo1/evaluate-test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181744,"global_rank":415303},{"name":"mi4l/Zero","owner":"mi4l","html_url":"https://github.com/mi4l/Zero","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"TODO app for desktop/mobile","topics":[],"score":181744,"global_rank":415304},{"name":"joviegas/test-aws-sdk-v1","owner":"joviegas","html_url":"https://github.com/joviegas/test-aws-sdk-v1","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181744,"global_rank":415305},{"name":"stcheng/CIS-542","owner":"stcheng","html_url":"https://github.com/stcheng/CIS-542","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"Embedded Systems Programming","topics":[],"score":181739,"global_rank":415307},{"name":"grayclhn/latex-shared","owner":"grayclhn","html_url":"https://github.com/gr